{"canonical_id":"xiuling-yaozhi","title":"修龄要指","author":"冷谦（明）","edition":"国学网（公版整理）","publication_date":"","source_url":"https://gushu.net.cn/","access_date":"2026-09-02","license":"公有领域","volume":"","chapter":"起居调摄","section":"","seq":15,"segId":"xiuling-yaozhi.15","text":"临睡时，调息咽津，叩齿，鸣天鼓。先睡眼，后睡心。侧曲而卧，觉直而伸。昼夜起居，乐在其中矣。","normalized_text":"临睡时，调息咽津，叩齿，鸣天鼓。先睡眼，后睡心。侧曲而卧，觉直而伸。昼夜起居，乐在其中矣。","charRange":[0,45],"tags":[],"annotations":"","transcription_confidence":0.9,"isPublicDomain":true,"confidence_level":"A"}
